        {
          "id": "/page/4/Text/13",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>In 2003 I started teaching at Olin College and I got to teach Python for the first time. The contrast with Java was striking. Students struggled less, learned more, worked on more interesting projects, and generally had a lot more fun.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.49609375,
