          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/4/SectionHeader/0",
            "3": "/page/4/SectionHeader/1"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/5/Text/2",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>The result is this book, now with the less grandiose title <i>Think Python</i>. Some of the changes are:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              86.0,
              122.58984375
            ],
            [
              482.90625,
              122.58984375
            ],
            [
              482.90625,
              145.0
            ],
            [
              86.0,
              145.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/4/SectionHeader/0",
            "3": "/page/4/SectionHeader/1"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/5/ListGroup/124",
          "block_type": "ListGroup",
          "html": "<p><ul><content-ref src='/page/5/ListItem/3'></content-ref><content-ref src='/page/5/ListItem/4'></content-ref><content-ref src='/page/5/ListItem/5'></content-ref><content-ref src='/page/5/ListItem/6'></content-ref><content-ref src='/page/5/ListItem/7'></content-ref></ul></p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              100.0,
              162.3251953125
            ],
            [
              483.205078125,
              162.3251953125
            ],
            [
              483.205078125,
              354.0
            ],
            [
              100.0,
              354.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "/page/5/ListItem/3",
              "block_type": "ListItem",
              "html": "<li> I added a section about debugging at the end of each chapter. These sections present general techniques for finding and avoiding bugs, and warnings about Python pitfalls.</li>",
              "polygon": [
                [
                  100.0,
                  162.3251953125
                ],
                [
                  483.205078125,
                  162.3251953125
                ],
                [
                  483.205078125,
                  197.1298828125
                ],
                [
                  100.0,
                  197.1298828125
                ]
              ],
              "children": null,
              "section_hierarchy": {
                "1": "/page/4/SectionHeader/0",
                "3": "/page/4/SectionHeader/1"
              },
              "images": {}
            },
            {
              "id": "/page/5/ListItem/4",
              "block_type": "ListItem",
              "html": "<li> I added more exercises, ranging from short tests of understanding to a few substantial projects. And I wrote solutions for most of them.</li>",
              "polygon": [
                [
                  100.0,
                  210.76171875
                ],
                [
                  482.90625,
                  210.76171875
                ],
                [
                  482.90625,
                  234.0
                ],
                [
                  100.0,
                  234.0
                ]
              ],
              "children": null,
              "section_hierarchy": {
                "1": "/page/4/SectionHeader/0",
                "3": "/page/4/SectionHeader/1"
              },
              "images": {}
            },
            {
              "id": "/page/5/ListItem/5",
              "block_type": "ListItem",
              "html": "<li> I added a series of case studies—longer examples with exercises, solutions, and discussion. Some are based on Swampy, a suite of Python programs I wrote for use in my classes. Swampy, code examples, and some solutions are available from http://thinkpython.com.</li>",
              "polygon": [
                [
                  100.0,
                  246.7265625
                ],
                [
                  483.205078125,
                  246.7265625
                ],
                [
                  483.205078125,
                  294.0
                ],
                [
                  100.0,
                  294.0
                ]
              ],
              "children": null,
              "section_hierarchy": {
                "1": "/page/4/SectionHeader/0",
                "3": "/page/4/SectionHeader/1"
              },
              "images": {}
            },
            {
              "id": "/page/5/ListItem/6",
              "block_type": "ListItem",
              "html": "<li> I expanded the discussion of program development plans and basic design patterns.</li>",
              "polygon": [
                [
                  100.0,
                  306.474609375
                ],
                [
                  482.0,
                  306.474609375
                ],
                [
                  482.0,
                  318.0
                ],
                [
                  100.0,
                  318.0
                ]
              ],
              "children": null,
              "section_hierarchy": {
                "1": "/page/4/SectionHeader/0",
                "3": "/page/4/SectionHeader/1"
              },
              "images": {}
            },
            {
              "id": "/page/5/ListItem/7",
              "block_type": "ListItem",
              "html": "<li> I added appendices about debugging, analysis of algorithms, and UML diagrams with Lumpy.</li>",
              "polygon": [
                [
                  100.0,
                  330.2578125
                ],
                [
                  482.90625,
                  330.2578125
                ],
