          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/27/Text/16",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>For the rest of this book, I'll use the print statement. If you are using Python 3, you will have to translate. But other than that, there are very few differences we have to worry about.</p>",
          "polygon": [
