          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/30/Text/7",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><i>If you run a 10 kilometer race in 43 minutes 30 seconds, what is your average time per mile? What</i> <i>is your average speed in miles per hour? (Hint: there are 1.61 kilometers in a mile).</i></p>",
