        },
        {
          "id": "/page/32/Text/4",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>These values belong to different <b>types</b>: 2 is an integer, and Hello, World! is a <b>string</b>, so-called because it contains a \"string\" of letters. You (and the interpreter) can identify strings because they are enclosed in quotation marks.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.197265625,
              386.912109375
