        {
          "id": "/page/32/Text/7",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Not surprisingly, strings belong to the type str and integers belong to the type int. Less obviously, numbers with a decimal point belong to a type called float, because these numbers are represented in a format called <b>floating-point</b>.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              129.69140625,
              503.12109375
