          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/32/Code/10",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>&gt;&gt;&gt; type(17)\n&lt;type 'str'&gt;\n&gt;&gt;&gt; type('3.2')\n&lt;type 'str'&gt;\nThey're strings.</pre>",
