          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/35/Text/5",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>An <b>expression</b> is a combination of values, variables, and operators. A value all by itself is considered an expression, and so is a variable, so the following are all legal expressions (assuming that the variable x has been assigned a value):</p>",
          "polygon": [
