        {
          "id": "/page/36/Text/7",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><i>Now put the same statements into a script and run it. What is the output? Modify the script by</i> <i>transforming each expression into a print statement and then run it again.</i></p>",
          "polygon": [
