            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/32/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/37/SectionHeader/19"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/37/Text/20",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>At this point the syntax error you are most likely to make is an illegal variable name, like class and yield, which are keywords, or odd~job and US$, which contain illegal characters.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
