          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/40/Text/3",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>In the context of programming, a <b>function</b> is a named sequence of statements that performs a computation. When you define a function, you specify the name and the sequence of statements. Later, you can \"call\" the function by name. We have already seen one example of a <b>function call</b>:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.794921875,
              323.490234375
            ],
            [
              527.431640625,
              323.490234375
            ],
            [
              527.431640625,
              371.056640625
            ],
            [
              128.794921875,
              371.056640625
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
