          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/40/Text/5",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>The name of the function is type. The expression in parentheses is called the <b>argument</b> of the function. The result, for this function, is the type of the argument.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.49609375,
