        {
          "id": "/page/40/Code/9",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>&gt;&gt;&gt; int(32)\n32\n&gt;&gt;&gt; int('Hello')\nValueError: invalid literal for int(): Hello\nint can convert floating-point values to integers, but it doesn't round off; it chops off the\nfraction part:\n&gt;&gt;&gt; int(3.99999)\n3\n&gt;&gt;&gt; int(-2.3)\n-2</pre>",
