          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/42/Text/16",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>The strings in the print statements are enclosed in double quotes. Single quotes and double quotes do the same thing; most people use single quotes except in cases like this where a single quote (which is also an apostrophe) appears in the string.</p>",
