        {
          "id": "/page/43/Code/4",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>&gt;&gt;&gt; print print_lyrics\n&lt;function print_lyrics at 0xb7e99e9c&gt;\n&gt;&gt;&gt; type(print_lyrics)\n&lt;type 'function'&gt;\nThe value of print_lyrics is a function object, which has type</pre>",
