        {
          "id": "/page/43/Text/7",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Once you have defined a function, you can use it inside another function. For example, to repeat the previous refrain, we could write a function called repeat_lyrics:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.6142578125,
              302.0
