        {
          "id": "/page/47/Text/11",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Void functions might display something on the screen or have some other effect, but they don't have a return value. If you try to assign the result to a variable, you get a special value called None. ''</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
