          "id": "/page/53/Code/14",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>fd(bob, 100)\nlt(bob)\nfd(bob, 100)\nlt(bob)\nfd(bob, 100)\nlt(bob)\nfd(bob, 100)\nWe can do the same thing more concisely with a for statement. Add this example to\nmypolygon.py and run it again:\nfor i in range(4):\n    print 'Hello!</pre>",
