          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/54/Text/2",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>This is the simplest use of the for statement; we will see more later. But that should be enough to let you rewrite your square-drawing program. Don't go on until you do.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.9443359375,
              140.4755859375
            ],
            [
              526.53515625,
              140.4755859375
            ],
            [
              526.53515625,
              164.0
            ],
            [
              128.9443359375,
              164.0
