              },
              "images": {}
            },
            {
              "id": "/page/54/ListItem/14",
              "block_type": "ListItem",
              "html": "<li>3. The functions lt and rt make 90-degree turns by default, but you can provide a second argument that specifies the number of degrees. For example, lt(bob, 45) turns bob 45 degrees to the left.</li>",
              "polygon": [
