        {
          "id": "/page/54/Text/15",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Make a copy of square and change the name to polygon. Add another parameter named n and modify the body so it draws an n-sided regular polygon. Hint: The exterior angles of an n-sided regular polygon are 360/n degrees.</p>",
