        {
          "id": "/page/55/Text/2",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Another hint: if bob is too slow for you, you can speed him up by changing bob.delay, which is the time between moves, in seconds. bob.delay = 0.01 ought to get him moving.</p>",
