        {
          "id": "/page/55/ListItem/3",
          "block_type": "ListItem",
          "html": "<li>5. Make a more general version of circle called arc that takes an additional parameter angle, which determines what fraction of a circle to draw. angle is in units of degrees, so when angle=360, arc should draw a complete circle.</li>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              98.015625,
