        {
          "id": "/page/61/Text/1",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>Exercise 4.4.</b> <i>The letters of the alphabet can be constructed from a moderate number of basic ele</i><i>ments, like vertical and horizontal lines and a few curves. Design a font that can be drawn with a</i> <i>minimal number of basic elements and then write functions that draw letters of the alphabet.</i></p>",
