          "html": "<p><i>You should write one function for each letter, with names</i> draw_a, draw_b<i>, etc., and put your</i> <i>functions in a file named</i> letters.py<i>. You can download a \"turtle typewriter\" from</i> http: // thinkpython. com/ code/ typewriter. py <i>to help you test your code.</i></p>",
