        {
          "id": "/page/65/Text/3",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Although the indentation of the statements makes the structure apparent, <b>nested condi</b><b>tionals</b> become difficult to read very quickly. In general, it is a good idea to avoid them when you can.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.6142578125,
