        },
        {
          "id": "/page/65/Text/4",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Logical operators often provide a way to simplify nested conditional statements. For example, we can rewrite the following code using a single conditional:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.46484375,
              227.197265625
            ],
