        {
          "id": "/page/65/Text/9",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>It is legal for one function to call another; it is also legal for a function to call itself. It may not be obvious why that is a good thing, but it turns out to be one of the most magical things a program can do. For example, look at the following function:</p>",
          "polygon": [
