        },
        {
          "id": "/page/68/Text/10",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>The traceback Python displays when an error occurs contains a lot of information, but it can be overwhelming, especially when there are many frames on the stack. The most useful parts are usually:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.6455078125,
              454.39453125
            ],
