        {
          "id": "/page/68/Text/13",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Syntax errors are usually easy to find, but there are a few gotchas. Whitespace errors can be tricky because spaces and tabs are invisible and we are used to ignoring them.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.6455078125,
              547.59375
