          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/68/Text/16",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>In this example, the problem is that the second line is indented by one space. But the error message points to y, which is misleading. In general, error messages indicate where the problem was discovered, but the actual error might be earlier in the code, sometimes on a previous line.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
