        {
          "id": "/page/70/ListItem/9",
          "block_type": "ListItem",
          "html": "<li><i>1. Write a function named</i> check_fermat <i>that takes four parameters—</i>a, b, c and n<i>—and that</i> <i>checks to see if Fermat's theorem holds. If n is greater than 2 and it turns out to be true that</i></li>",
