          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/72/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/72/SectionHeader/2",
          "block_type": "SectionHeader",
          "html": "<h3><b>6.1 Return values</b></h3>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.794921875,
              298.0
            ],
            [
              253.0,
              298.0
            ],
            [
              253.0,
              313.0
            ],
            [
              128.794921875,
              313.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/72/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/72/Text/3",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Some of the built-in functions we have used, such as the math functions, produce results. Calling the function generates a value, which we usually assign to a variable or use as part of an expression.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.9443359375,
              327.0
            ],
            [
              526.53515625,
              327.0
            ],
            [
              526.53515625,
              362.0
            ],
            [
              128.9443359375,
              362.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/72/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/72/Code/4",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>e = math.exp(1.0)\nheight = radius * math.sin(radians)</pre>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              129.392578125,
              367.76953125
            ],
            [
              313.0,
              367.76953125
            ],
            [
              313.0,
              391.0
            ],
            [
              129.392578125,
              391.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/72/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/72/Text/5",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>All of the functions we have written so far are void; they print something or move turtles around, but their return value is None.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.794921875,
              397.93359375
            ],
            [
              526.236328125,
              397.93359375
            ],
            [
              526.236328125,
              422.0
            ],
            [
              128.794921875,
              422.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/72/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/72/Text/6",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>In this chapter, we are (finally) going to write fruitful functions. The first example is area, which returns the area of a circle with the given radius:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.9443359375,
              432.73828125
            ],
            [
              526.53515625,
              432.73828125
            ],
            [
              526.53515625,
              456.0
            ],
            [
              128.9443359375,
              456.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/72/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/72/Code/7",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>def area(radius):\n    temp = math.pi * radius**2\n    return temp</pre>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              130.0,
              463.0
            ],
            [
              287.0,
              463.0
            ],
            [
              287.0,
              498.0
            ],
            [
              130.0,
              498.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/72/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/72/Text/8",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>We have seen the return statement before, but in a fruitful function the return statement includes an expression. This statement means: \"Return immediately from this function and use the following expression as a return value.\" The expression can be arbitrarily complicated, so we could have written this function more concisely:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.9443359375,
              505.828125
            ],
            [
              526.53515625,
              505.828125
            ],
            [
              526.53515625,
              552.234375
            ],
            [
              128.9443359375,
              552.234375
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/72/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/72/Text/9",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>def area(radius): return math.pi * radius**2</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.72021484375,
              559.1953125
            ],
            [
              287.0,
              559.1953125
            ],
            [
              287.0,
              582.0
            ],
            [
              128.72021484375,
              582.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/72/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/72/Text/10",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>On the other hand, <b>temporary variables</b> like temp often make debugging easier.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.6455078125,
              589.74609375
            ],
            [
              481.11328125,
              589.74609375
            ],
            [
              481.11328125,
              600.57421875
            ],
            [
              128.6455078125,
              600.57421875
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/72/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/72/Text/11",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Sometimes it is useful to have multiple return statements, one in each branch of a conditional:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.3466796875,
              611.015625
            ],
            [
              526.0,
              611.015625
            ],
            [
              526.0,
              634.21875
            ],
            [
              128.3466796875,
              634.21875
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/72/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/72/Code/12",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>def absolute_value(x):\n    if x &lt; 0:\n        return -x\n    else:\n        return x</pre>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.0478515625,
              642.0
            ],
            [
              245.0,
              642.0
            ],
            [
              245.0,
              701.89453125
            ],
            [
              128.0478515625,
              701.89453125
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/72/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        }
      ],
      "section_hierarchy": {
