      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "/page/76/PageHeader/0",
          "block_type": "PageHeader",
          "html": "<p><b>6.5. More recursion 55</b></p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.12255859375,
              61.0
            ],
            [
              526.0,
              61.0
            ],
            [
              526.0,
              71.0
            ],
            [
              128.12255859375,
              71.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/75/SectionHeader/15"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/76/PageHeader/16",
          "block_type": "PageHeader",
          "html": "<p></p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              515.1796875,
              61.0048828125
            ],
            [
              525.9375,
              61.0048828125
            ],
            [
              525.9375,
              70.4794921875
            ],
            [
              515.1796875,
              70.4794921875
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/75/SectionHeader/15"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/76/Text/1",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>It is common to give boolean functions names that sound like yes/no questions; is_divisible returns either True or False to indicate whether x is divisible by y.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              129.09375,
              88.12353515625
            ],
            [
              526.0,
              88.12353515625
            ],
            [
              526.0,
              111.0
            ],
            [
              129.09375,
              111.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/75/SectionHeader/15"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/76/Code/2",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>Here is an example:\n&gt;&gt;&gt; is_divisible(6, 4)\nFalse\n&gt;&gt;&gt; is_divisible(6, 3)\nTrue\nThe result of the == operator is a boolean, so we can write the function more concisely by\nreturning it directly:\ndef is_divisible(x, y):\n    return x % y == 0</pre>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              129.2431640625,
              119.689453125
            ],
            [
              526.0,
              119.689453125
            ],
            [
              526.0,
              236.0
            ],
            [
              129.2431640625,
              236.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/75/SectionHeader/15"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/76/Text/3",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Boolean functions are often used in conditional statements:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.57080078125,
              240.345703125
            ],
            [
              390.8671875,
              240.345703125
            ],
            [
              390.8671875,
              251.0
            ],
            [
              128.57080078125,
              251.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/75/SectionHeader/15"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/76/Code/4",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>if is_divisible(x, y):\n    print 'x is divisible by y'</pre>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              129.2431640625,
              255.0
            ],
            [
              326.91796875,
              255.0
            ],
            [
              326.91796875,
              282.884765625
            ],
            [
              129.2431640625,
              282.884765625
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/75/SectionHeader/15"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/76/Text/5",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>It might be tempting to write something like:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.86962890625,
              284.0
            ],
            [
              327.0,
              284.0
            ],
            [
              327.0,
              294.873046875
            ],
            [
              128.86962890625,
              294.873046875
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/72/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/75/SectionHeader/15"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/76/Code/6",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>if is_divisible(x, y) == True:\n    print 'x is divisible by y'</pre>",
          "polygon": [
