        {
          "id": "/page/76/Text/8",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>Exercise 6.3.</b> <i>Write a function</i> is_between(x, y, z) <i>that returns</i> True <i>if x</i> ≤ y ≤ <i>z or</i> False <i>otherwise.</i></p>",
          "polygon": [
