        {
          "id": "/page/81/Text/2",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>If you are confused about the flow of execution, this kind of output can be helpful. It takes some time to develop effective scaffolding, but a little bit of scaffolding can save a lot of debugging.</p>",
