          "html": "<p><b>Exercise 6.7.</b> <i>A number, a, is a power of b if it is divisible by b and a</i>/<i>b is a power of b. Write a</i> <i>function called</i> is_power <i>that takes parameters</i> a and b <i>and returns</i> True if a <i>is a power of</i> b<i>. Note:</i> <i>you will have to think about the base case.</i></p>",
