          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/84/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/85/SectionHeader/12"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/85/Text/17",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>You can almost read the while statement as if it were English. It means, \"While n is greater than 0, display the value of n and then reduce the value of n by 1. When you get to 0, display the word Blastoff!\"</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.6142578125,
              619.91015625
            ],
            [
              482.90625,
              619.91015625
            ],
            [
              482.90625,
              656.0
            ],
            [
              85.6142578125,
              656.0
            ]
