        {
          "id": "/page/90/Text/8",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>Exercise 7.3.</b> <i>To test the square root algorithm in this chapter, you could compare it with</i> math.sqrt<i>. Write a function named</i> test_square_root <i>that prints a table like this:</i></p>",
