        },
        {
          "id": "/page/90/Text/10",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><i>The first column is a number, a; the second column is the square root of a computed with the function</i> <i>from Section 7.5; the third column is the square root computed by</i> math.sqrt<i>; the fourth column is</i> <i>the absolute value of the difference between the two estimates.</i></p>",
