        {
          "id": "/page/90/Text/11",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>Exercise 7.4.</b> <i>The built-in function</i> eval <i>takes a string and evaluates it using the Python inter</i><i>preter. For example:</i> ''</p>",
