        {
          "id": "/page/90/Text/13",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><i>Write a function called</i> eval_loop <i>that iteratively prompts the user, takes the resulting input and</i> <i>evaluates it using</i> eval<i>, and prints the result.</i> ''</p>",
