        {
          "id": "/page/94/Text/7",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Of course, that's not quite right because \"Ouack\" and \"Quack\" are misspelled. <b>Exercise 8.2.</b> <i>Modify the program to fix this error.</i></p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
