        {
          "id": "/page/97/Text/1",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>It can take as a second argument the index where it should start: &gt;&gt;&gt; word.find('na', 3) 4 And as a third argument the index where it should stop: &gt;&gt;&gt; name = 'bob'  &gt;&gt;&gt; name.find('b', 1, 2) -1</p>",
