          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>Exercise 8.8.</b> <i>Read the documentation of the string methods at</i> http: // docs. python. org/ 2/ library/ stdtypes. html# string-methods <i>. You might want to experiment with some of them</i> <i>to make sure you understand how they work.</i> strip and replace <i>are particularly useful.</i></p>",
          "polygon": [
