        {
          "id": "/page/97/Text/4",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><i>The documentation uses a syntax that might be confusing. For example, in</i> find(sub[, start[, end]])<i>, the brackets indicate optional arguments. So</i> sub <i>is required, but</i> start <i>is optional, and if you include</i> start<i>, then</i> end <i>is optional.</i></p>",
          "polygon": [
