        },
        {
          "id": "/page/97/Text/8",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>With well-chosen variable names, Python sometimes reads like English. You could read this loop, \"for (each) letter in (the first) word, if (the) letter (appears) in (the second) word, print (the) letter.\"</p>",
