          "html": "<pre>if word &lt; banana:\n    print 'Your word,' + word + ', comes before banana.'elif word &gt; 'banana':\n    print 'Your word,' + word + ', comes after banana.'\n                                                          \nelse:\n    print 'All right, bananas.'</pre>",
