          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/102/Text/4",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>This file is in plain text, so you can open it with a text editor, but you can also read it from Python. The built-in function open takes the name of the file as a parameter and returns a <b>file object</b> you can use to read the file. ''</p>",
