          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/103/Text/5",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>Exercise 9.2.</b> <i>In 1939 Ernest Vincent Wright published a 50,000 word novel called</i> Gadsby <i>that</i> <i>does not contain the letter \"e.\" Since \"e\" is the most common letter in English, that's not easy to</i> do.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.9130859375,
              314.015625
            ],
            [
              483.50390625,
              314.015625
            ],
            [
              483.50390625,
              349.0
            ],
            [
              85.9130859375,
              349.0
