          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/106/Text/5",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Testing programs is hard. The functions in this chapter are relatively easy to test because you can check the results by hand. Even so, it is somewhere between difficult and impossible to choose a set of words that test for all possible errors.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.6455078125,
              223.5234375
            ],
            [
