        {
          "id": "/page/108/Text/13",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>The syntax for accessing the elements of a list is the same as for accessing the characters of a string—the bracket operator. The expression inside the brackets specifies the index. Remember that the indices start at 0:</p>",
