          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>&gt;&gt;&gt; a = [1, 2, 3]\n&gt;&gt;&gt; b = [4, 5, 6]\n&gt;&gt;&gt; c = a + b\n&gt;&gt;&gt; print c\n[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]</pre>",
