          "id": "/page/112/Text/4",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>total is initialized to 0. Each time through the loop, x gets one element from the list. The += operator provides a short way to update a variable. This <b>augmented assignment</b> <b>statement</b>:</p>",
