          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/112/Text/13",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Sometimes you want to traverse one list while building another. For example, the following function takes a list of strings and returns a new list that contains capitalized strings:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              129.2431640625,
              442.40625
            ],
            [
              526.53515625,
              442.40625
            ],
            [
