        {
          "id": "/page/114/Text/4",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Because list is the name of a built-in function, you should avoid using it as a variable name. I also avoid l because it looks too much like 1. So that's why I use t.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              129.69140625,
              206.701171875
            ],
