          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>&gt;&gt;&gt; s = pining for the fjords\n                                  \n&gt;&gt;&gt; t = s.split()\n&gt;&gt;&gt; print t\n['pining', 'for', 'the', 'fjords']</pre>",
