        {
          "id": "/page/116/Text/6",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Although this behavior can be useful, it is error-prone. In general, it is safer to avoid aliasing when you are working with mutable objects.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              129.09375,
              303.57421875
            ],
            [
              526.0,
              303.57421875
            ],
            [
              526.0,
              326.390625
