        {
          "id": "/page/116/Text/12",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>When you pass a list to a function, the function gets a reference to the list. If the function modifies a list parameter, the caller sees the change. For example, delete_head removes the first element from a list:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              129.2431640625,
              447.0
            ],
            [
              526.53515625,
              447.0
            ],
            [
              526.53515625,
              482.0
            ],
            [
              129.2431640625,
              482.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/108/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/116/SectionHeader/11"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/116/Code/13",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>def delete_head(t):\n    del t[0]</pre>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.6455078125,
              487.265625
            ],
            [
              229.3505859375,
              487.265625
            ],
            [
              229.3505859375,
              510.46875
