              "html": "<li><i>2. If there are 23 students in your class, what are the chances that two of you have the same</i> <i>birthday? You can estimate this probability by generating random samples of 23 birthdays and</i> <i>checking for matches. Hint: you can generate random birthdays with the</i> randint <i>function</i> <i>in the</i> random <i>module.</i></li>",
              "polygon": [
                [
                  98.314453125,
                  467.9296875
                ],
                [
                  482.30859375,
                  467.9296875
                ],
                [
                  482.30859375,
                  515.0
                ],
                [
                  98.314453125,
                  515.0
                ]
              ],
              "children": null,
              "section_hierarchy": {
                "1": "/page/108/SectionHeader/1",
