        {
          "id": "/page/120/Text/1",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><i>You start in the middle and check to see whether the word you are looking for comes before the word</i> <i>in the middle of the list. If so, then you search the first half of the list the same way. Otherwise you</i> <i>search the second half.</i></p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.794921875,
              88.365234375
            ],
            [
              526.236328125,
              88.365234375
            ],
            [
              526.236328125,
              123.0
            ],
            [
              128.794921875,
              123.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/108/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/119/SectionHeader/9"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/120/Text/2",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><i>Either way, you cut the remaining search space in half. If the word list has 113,809 words, it will</i> <i>take about 17 steps to find the word or conclude that it's not there.</i></p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              129.2431640625,
              132.2578125
            ],
            [
              527.73046875,
              132.2578125
            ],
            [
              527.73046875,
              155.0
            ],
            [
              129.2431640625,
              155.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/108/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/119/SectionHeader/9"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/120/Text/3",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><i>Write a function called</i> bisect <i>that takes a sorted list and a target value and returns the index of</i> <i>the value in the list, if it's there, or</i> None <i>if it's not.</i></p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.6455078125,
              164.935546875
