          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/120/Text/6",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>Exercise 10.13.</b> <i>Two words \"interlock\" if taking alternating letters from each forms a new</i> <i>word. For example, \"shoe\" and \"cold\" interlock to form \"schooled.\" Solution:</i> http: // thinkpython. com/ code/ interlock. py <i>. Credit: This exercise is inspired by an example at</i> http: // puzzlers. org .</p>",
