          "children": [
            {
              "id": "/page/123/ListItem/16",
              "block_type": "ListItem",
              "html": "<li>1. You could create 26 variables, one for each letter of the alphabet. Then you could traverse the string and, for each character, increment the corresponding counter, probably using a chained conditional.</li>",
              "polygon": [
