        {
          "id": "/page/124/ListItem/1",
          "block_type": "ListItem",
          "html": "<li>3. You could create a dictionary with characters as keys and counters as the corresponding values. The first time you see a character, you would add an item to the dictionary. After that you would increment the value of an existing item.</li>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              141.1962890625,
              88.12353515625
            ],
