        {
          "id": "/page/125/Code/1",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>def print_hist(h):\n    for c in h:\n        print c, h[c]\nHere's what the output looks like:\n&gt;&gt;&gt; h = histogram('parrot')\n&gt;&gt;&gt; print_hist(h)\na 1\np 1\nr 2\nt 1\no 1</pre>",
