        {
          "id": "/page/125/Text/3",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>Exercise 11.3.</b> <i>Dictionaries have a method called</i> keys <i>that returns the keys of the dictionary, in</i> <i>no particular order, as a list.</i></p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
