            {
              "id": "/page/131/ListItem/16",
              "block_type": "ListItem",
              "html": "<li><b>hashable:</b> A type that has a hash function. Immutable types like integers, floats and strings are hashable; mutable types like lists and dictionaries are not.</li>",
