        {
          "id": "/page/132/Text/5",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>Exercise 11.9.</b> <i>If you did Exercise 10.8, you already have a function named</i> has_duplicates <i>that</i> <i>takes a list as a parameter and returns</i> True <i>if there is any object that appears more than once in the</i> <i>list.</i></p>",
