          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><i>Use a dictionary to write a faster, simpler version of</i> has_duplicates<i>. Solution:</i> http: // thinkpython. com/ code/ has_ duplicates. py .</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              129.5419921875,
