        {
          "id": "/page/132/Text/7",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>Exercise 11.10.</b> <i>Two words are \"rotate pairs\" if you can rotate one of them and get the other (see</i> rotate_word <i>in Exercise 8.12).</i></p>",
          "polygon": [
