          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/132/Text/15",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><i>Write a program that lists all the words that solve the Puzzler. Solution:</i> http: // thinkpython. com/ code/ homophone. py .</p>",
