          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>&gt;&gt;&gt; t1 = a,\n&gt;&gt;&gt; type(t1)\n&lt;type 'tuple'&gt;\nA value in parentheses is not a tuple:\n&gt;&gt;&gt; t2 = ('a')\n&gt;&gt;&gt; type(t2)\n&lt;type 'str'&gt;\nAnother way to create a tuple is the built-in function tuple. With no argument, it creates\nan empty tuple:\n&gt;&gt;&gt; t = tuple()\n&gt;&gt;&gt; print t</pre>",
