        {
          "id": "/page/138/Code/8",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>&gt;&gt;&gt; t = [(a, 0), (c, 2), (b, 1)]\n&gt;&gt;&gt; d = dict(t)\n&gt;&gt;&gt; print d\n{'a': 0, 'c': 2, 'b': 1}\nCombining dict with zip yields a concise way to create a dictionary:\n&gt;&gt;&gt; d = dict(zip('abc', range(3)))\n&gt;&gt;&gt; print d\n{'a': 0, 'c': 2, 'b': 1}</pre>",
          "polygon": [
