        {
          "id": "/page/138/Text/14",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>It is common to use tuples as keys in dictionaries (primarily because you can't use lists). For example, a telephone directory might map from last-name, first-name pairs to telephone numbers. Assuming that we have defined last, first and number, we could write:</p>",
          "polygon": [
