        },
        {
          "id": "/page/139/Text/8",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>This loop traverses the keys in directory, which are tuples. It assigns the elements of each tuple to last and first, then prints the name and corresponding telephone number.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.3154296875,
              343.79296875
            ],
            [
