          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/144/Text/6",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><i>Also, you might consider using the string methods</i> strip, replace and translate. <b>Exercise 13.2.</b> <i>Go to Project Gutenberg (</i>http: // gutenberg. org <i>) and download your favorite</i> <i>out-of-copyright book in plain text format.</i></p>",
