        {
          "id": "/page/146/Text/2",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>You should attempt the previous exercises before you go on. You can download my solution from http://thinkpython.com/code/analyze_book.py. You will also need http: //thinkpython.com/code/emma.txt.</p>",
