        {
          "id": "/page/147/Text/3",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>To find the most common words, we can apply the DSU pattern; most_common takes a histogram and returns a list of word-frequency tuples, sorted in reverse order by frequency:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.6142578125,
