        {
          "id": "/page/148/Text/4",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Finding the words from the book that are not in the word list from words.txt is a problem you might recognize as set subtraction; that is, we want to find all the words from one set (the words in the book) that are not in another set (the words in the list).</p>",
