          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/148/Text/5",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>subtract takes dictionaries d1 and d2 and returns a new dictionary that contains all the keys from d1 that are not in d2. Since we don't really care about the values, we set them all to None.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              129.392578125,
