          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/148/Code/6",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>def subtract(d1, d2):\n    res = dict()\n    for key in d1:\n        if key not in d2:\n             res[key] = None\n    return res\nTo find the words in the book that are not in words.txt, we can use process_file to build\na histogram for words.txt, and then subtract:\nwords = process_file('words.txt')</pre>",
