        {
          "id": "/page/148/Text/14",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>Exercise 13.6.</b> <i>Python provides a data structure called</i> set <i>that provides many common set opera</i><i>tions. Read the documentation at</i> http: // docs. python. org/ 2/ library/ stdtypes. html# types-set <i>and write a program that uses set subtraction to find words in the book that are not in</i> <i>the word list. Solution:</i> http: // thinkpython. com/ code/ analyze_ book2. py .</p>",
