        {
          "id": "/page/149/Text/3",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>The expression [word] * freq creates a list with freq copies of the string word. The extend method is similar to append except that the argument is a sequence. <b>Exercise 13.7.</b> <i>This algorithm works, but it is not very efficient; each time you choose a random</i></p>",
