        },
        {
          "id": "/page/153/SectionHeader/1",
          "block_type": "SectionHeader",
          "html": "<h3><b>13.11 Glossary</b></h3>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.9130859375,
              86.0
            ],
            [
              191.0,
              86.0
            ],
            [
              191.0,
              100.0
            ],
            [
              85.9130859375,
              100.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/144/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/153/SectionHeader/1"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/153/Text/2",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>deterministic:</b> Pertaining to a program that does the same thing each time it runs, given the same inputs.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.46484375,
              108.28125
            ],
            [
              482.607421875,
              108.28125
            ],
            [
              482.607421875,
              132.0
            ],
            [
              85.46484375,
              132.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/144/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/153/SectionHeader/1"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/153/ListItem/3",
          "block_type": "ListItem",
          "html": "<li><b>pseudorandom:</b> Pertaining to a sequence of numbers that appear to be random, but are generated by a deterministic program.</li>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.0166015625,
              140.765625
            ],
            [
              482.30859375,
              140.765625
            ],
            [
              482.30859375,
              164.162109375
            ],
            [
              85.0166015625,
              164.162109375
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/144/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/153/SectionHeader/1"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/153/Text/4",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>default value:</b> The value given to an optional parameter if no argument is provided.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.6142578125,
              173.443359375
            ],
            [
              459.0,
              173.443359375
            ],
            [
              459.0,
              184.0
            ],
            [
              85.6142578125,
              184.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/144/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/153/SectionHeader/1"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/153/Text/5",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>override:</b> To replace a default value with an argument.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.39013671875,
              193.4560546875
            ],
            [
              329.0,
              193.4560546875
            ],
            [
              329.0,
              204.0
            ],
            [
              85.39013671875,
              204.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/144/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/153/SectionHeader/1"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/153/ListItem/6",
          "block_type": "ListItem",
          "html": "<li><b>benchmarking:</b> The process of choosing between data structures by implementing alternatives and testing them on a sample of the possible inputs.</li>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.3154296875,
              212.888671875
            ],
            [
              482.90625,
              212.888671875
            ],
            [
              482.90625,
              237.0
            ],
            [
              85.3154296875,
              237.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/144/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/153/SectionHeader/7"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/153/SectionHeader/7",
          "block_type": "SectionHeader",
          "html": "<h3><b>13.12 Exercises</b></h3>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.9130859375,
              264.90234375
            ],
            [
              193.0,
              264.90234375
            ],
            [
              193.0,
              280.0
            ],
            [
              85.9130859375,
              280.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/144/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/153/SectionHeader/7"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/153/Text/8",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>Exercise 13.9.</b> <i>The \"rank\" of a word is its position in a list of words sorted by frequency: the most</i> <i>common word has rank 1, the second most common has rank 2, etc.</i></p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.6142578125,
              291.5859375
            ],
            [
              482.30859375,
              291.5859375
            ],
            [
              482.30859375,
              315.0
            ],
            [
              85.6142578125,
              315.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/144/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/153/SectionHeader/7"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/153/Text/9",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><i>Zipf's law describes a relationship between the ranks and frequencies of words in natural languages</i> (http: // en. wikipedia. org/ wiki/ Zipf's_ law <i>). Specifically, it predicts that the frequency,</i> <i>f , of the word with rank r is:</i></p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.46484375,
              324.0703125
            ],
            [
              482.90625,
              324.0703125
            ],
            [
              482.90625,
              359.26171875
            ],
            [
              85.46484375,
              359.26171875
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/144/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/153/SectionHeader/7"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/153/TextInlineMath/10",
          "block_type": "TextInlineMath",
          "html": "<p>f = cr−s</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              263.4169921875,
              378.0
            ],
            [
              304.0576171875,
              378.0
            ],
