          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/153/Text/15",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><i>Solution:</i> http: // thinkpython. com/ code/ zipf. py <i>. To make the plots, you might have to</i> <i>install matplotlib (see</i> http: // matplotlib. sourceforge. net/ ).</p>",
