        {
          "id": "/page/155/Code/1",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>&gt;&gt;&gt; line1 = \"This heres the wattle,\\n\"\n&gt;&gt;&gt; fout.write(line1)\nAgain, the file object keeps track of where it is, so if you call write again, it adds the new\ndata to the end.\n&gt;&gt;&gt; line2 = \"the emblem of our land.\\n\"\n&gt;&gt;&gt; fout.write(line2)\nWhen you are done writing, you have to close the file.</pre>",
          "polygon": [
