          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/155/Text/8",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>For example, the format sequence %d means that the second operand should be formatted as an integer (d stands for \"decimal\"):</p>",
          "polygon": [
