        {
          "id": "/page/155/Code/15",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>&gt;&gt;&gt; In %d years I have spotted %g %s. % (3, 0.1, camels)\n'In 3 years I have spotted 0.1 camels.'</pre>",
