        },
        {
          "id": "/page/157/Text/5",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>A lot of things can go wrong when you try to read and write files. If you try to open a file that doesn't exist, you get an IOError: ''</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              86.0,
              258.908203125
            ],
            [
