        {
          "id": "/page/157/Text/10",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Python starts by executing the try clause. If all goes well, it skips the except clause and proceeds. If an exception occurs, it jumps out of the try clause and executes the except clause.</p>",
