        {
          "id": "/page/158/Text/3",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>A <b>database</b> is a file that is organized for storing data. Most databases are organized like a dictionary in the sense that they map from keys to values. The biggest difference is that the database is on disk (or other permanent storage), so it persists after the program ends.</p>",
          "polygon": [
