          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/162/Text/3",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>For most systems, there are applications to convert from one format to another. You can find them (and read more about this issue) at http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Newline. Or, of course, you could write one yourself.</p>",
