            "3": "/page/165/SectionHeader/9"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/166/Text/6",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Inside the function, p is an alias for blank, so if the function modifies p, blank changes. <b>Exercise 15.1.</b> <i>Write a function called</i> distance_between_points <i>that takes two Points as ar</i><i>guments and returns the distance between them.</i></p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              129.2431640625,
              254.0
            ],
            [
              526.0,
              254.0
            ],
            [
              526.0,
              289.0
