        {
          "id": "/page/170/Text/12",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>Exercise 15.4.</b> <i>Swampy (see Chapter 4) provides a module named</i> World<i>, which defines a user</i><i>defined type also called</i> World<i>. You can import it like this:</i></p>",
