          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>Exercise 16.1.</b> <i>Write a function called</i> print_time <i>that takes a Time object and prints it in the</i> <i>form</i> hour:minute:second<i>. Hint: the format sequence</i> '%.2d' <i>prints an integer using at least</i> <i>two digits, including a leading zero if necessary.</i></p>",
