        {
          "id": "/page/172/Text/14",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>In the next few sections, we'll write two functions that add time values. They demonstrate two kinds of functions: pure functions and modifiers. They also demonstrate a development plan I'll call <b>prototype and patch</b>, which is a way of tackling a complex problem by starting with a simple prototype and incrementally dealing with the complications.</p>",
