          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/176/Text/14",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>prototype and patch:</b> A development plan that involves writing a rough draft of a program, testing, and correcting errors as they are found.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.794921875,
              646.59375
            ],
            [
              526.0,
              646.59375
            ],
            [
              526.0,
              669.0234375
            ],
            [
              128.794921875,
              669.0234375
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/172/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/176/SectionHeader/13"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/176/Text/15",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>planned development:</b> A development plan that involves high-level insight into the problem and more planning than incremental development or prototype development.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.794921875,
              677.53125
