          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/172/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/177/SectionHeader/5"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/177/Text/9",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>Exercise 16.7.</b> The datetime <i>module provides</i> date and time <i>objects that are similar to the Date</i> <i>and Time objects in this chapter, but they provide a rich set of methods and operators. Read the</i> <i>documentation at</i> http: // docs. python. org/ 2/ library/ datetime. html .</p>",
