          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/179/Text/13",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>In this use of dot notation, Time is the name of the class, and print_time is the name of the method. start is passed as a parameter.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.3154296875,
              548.0
