          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/181/SectionHeader/8",
          "block_type": "SectionHeader",
          "html": "<h3><b>17.5 The init method</b></h3>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              86.0,
              275.73046875
            ],
            [
              232.0,
              275.73046875
            ],
            [
              232.0,
              294.0
            ],
            [
              86.0,
              294.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/178/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/181/SectionHeader/8"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/181/Text/9",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>The init method (short for \"initialization\") is a special method that gets invoked when an object is instantiated. Its full name is __init__ (two underscore characters, followed by init, and then two more underscores). An init method for the Time class might look like this:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.9130859375,
              302.607421875
            ],
            [
              482.90625,
              302.607421875
            ],
            [
              482.90625,
              351.333984375
            ],
            [
              85.9130859375,
              351.333984375
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/178/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/181/SectionHeader/8"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/181/Text/10",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p># inside class Time:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.83837890625,
              354.234375
            ],
            [
              191.0,
              354.234375
            ],
            [
              191.0,
              366.0
            ],
            [
              85.83837890625,
              366.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/178/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/181/SectionHeader/8"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/181/Code/11",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>def __init__(self, hour=0, minute=0, second=0):\n        self.hour = hour\n        self.minute = minute\n        self.second = second\nIt is common for the parameters of __init__ to have the same names as the attributes. The</pre>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              86.0,
              378.984375
            ],
            [
              482.0,
              378.984375
            ],
            [
              482.0,
              441.0
            ],
            [
              86.0,
              441.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/178/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/181/SectionHeader/8"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/181/Text/12",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>statement</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              86.0,
              440.859375
            ],
            [
              129.0,
              440.859375
            ],
            [
              129.0,
              453.0
            ],
            [
              86.0,
              453.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/178/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/181/SectionHeader/8"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/181/Text/13",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>self.hour = hour</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              125.5078125,
              457.1015625
            ],
            [
              212.0,
              455.5546875
            ],
            [
              212.0,
              468.0
            ],
            [
              125.5078125,
              468.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/178/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/181/SectionHeader/8"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/181/Text/14",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>stores the value of the parameter hour as an attribute of self.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.46484375,
              471.0234375
            ],
            [
              356.501953125,
              471.0234375
            ],
            [
              356.501953125,
              483.3984375
            ],
            [
              85.46484375,
              483.3984375
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/178/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/181/SectionHeader/8"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/181/Text/15",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>The parameters are optional, so if you call Time with no arguments, you get the default values.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.9130859375,
              488.42578125
            ],
            [
              483.50390625,
              488.42578125
            ],
            [
              483.50390625,
              513.0
            ],
            [
              85.9130859375,
              513.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/178/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/181/SectionHeader/8"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/181/Text/16",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>&gt;&gt;&gt; time = Time() &gt;&gt;&gt; time.print_time() 00:00:00</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.46484375,
              512.7890625
            ],
