          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/178/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/181/SectionHeader/8"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/181/Text/21",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>And if you provide three arguments, they override all three default values. <b>Exercise 17.2.</b> <i>Write an init method for the</i> Point <i>class that takes</i> x and y <i>as optional parameters</i> <i>and assigns them to the corresponding attributes.</i></p>",
