              },
              "images": {}
            },
            {
              "id": "/page/186/ListItem/11",
              "block_type": "ListItem",
              "html": "<li><b>information hiding:</b> The principle that the interface provided by an object should not depend on its implementation, in particular the representation of its attributes.</li>",
