        {
          "id": "/page/186/Text/13",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>Exercise 17.7.</b> <i>This exercise is a cautionary tale about one of the most common, and difficult to</i> <i>find, errors in Python. Write a definition for a class named</i> Kangaroo <i>with the following methods:</i></p>",
