        {
          "id": "/page/187/Text/9",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><i>If you run this code, you should see a window with a black background and a blue sphere. If you</i> <i>drag the middle button up and down, you can zoom in and out. You can also rotate the scene by</i> <i>dragging the right button, but with only one sphere in the world, it is hard to tell the difference.</i></p>",
          "polygon": [
