          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/188/Text/10",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>This code makes it easy to compare cards; because higher suits map to higher numbers, we can compare suits by comparing their codes.</p>",
          "polygon": [
