          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/188/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/188/SectionHeader/4"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/189/Code/5",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>class Card(object):\n    \"\"\"Represents a standard playing card.\"\"\"\n    def __init__(self, suit=0, rank=2):\n        self.suit = suit\n        self.rank = rank\nAs usual, the init method takes an optional parameter for each attribute. The default card</pre>",
          "polygon": [
