          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/189/Text/9",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>In order to print Card objects in a way that people can easily read, we need a mapping from the integer codes to the corresponding ranks and suits. A natural way to do that is with lists of strings. We assign these lists to <b>class attributes</b>:</p>",
          "polygon": [
