          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/188/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/191/SectionHeader/3"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/191/Text/4",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Now that we have Cards, the next step is to define Decks. Since a deck is made up of cards, it is natural for each Deck to contain a list of cards as an attribute.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              86.0,
              503.5078125
            ],
            [
              482.90625,
              503.5078125
            ],
            [
              482.90625,
              526.0
            ],
            [
              86.0,
              526.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/188/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/191/SectionHeader/3"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/191/Text/5",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>The following is a class definition for Deck. The init method creates the attribute cards and generates the standard set of fifty-two cards:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.763671875,
              535.21875
            ],
            [
              482.009765625,
              535.21875
            ],
            [
              482.009765625,
              559.1953125
            ],
            [
              85.763671875,
              559.1953125
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/188/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/191/SectionHeader/3"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/191/Code/6",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>class Deck(object):</pre>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.3154296875,
              563.0625
            ],
            [
              186.0,
              563.0625
            ],
            [
              186.0,
              575.0
            ],
            [
              85.3154296875,
              575.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/188/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/191/SectionHeader/3"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/191/Code/7",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>def __init__(self):\n    self.cards = []\n    for suit in range(4):\n        for rank in range(1, 14):\n            card = Card(suit, rank)\n            self.cards.append(card)</pre>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              106.5322265625,
              588.5859375
            ],
            [
              290.0,
              588.5859375
            ],
            [
              290.0,
              662.0625
            ],
            [
              106.5322265625,
              662.0625
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/188/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/191/SectionHeader/3"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/191/Text/8",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>The easiest way to populate the deck is with a nested loop. The outer loop enumerates the suits from 0 to 3. The inner loop enumerates the ranks from 1 to 13. Each iteration creates a new Card with the current suit and rank, and appends it to self.cards.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              85.6142578125,
              665.9296875
            ],
            [
              483.50390625,
              665.9296875
            ],
            [
              483.50390625,
              701.0
            ],
            [
              85.6142578125,
              701.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/188/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/191/SectionHeader/3"
          },
          "images": {}
        }
      ],
