          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/193/Text/17",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Hand also inherits __init__ from Deck, but it doesn't really do what we want: instead of populating the hand with 52 new cards, the init method for Hands should initialize cards with an empty list.</p>",
          "polygon": [
