          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/200/SectionHeader/2",
          "block_type": "SectionHeader",
          "html": "<h3><b>19.1 GUI</b></h3>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.72021484375,
              294.486328125
            ],
            [
              198.421875,
              294.486328125
            ],
            [
              198.421875,
              309.0
            ],
            [
              128.72021484375,
              309.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/200/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/200/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/200/Text/3",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Most of the programs we have seen so far are text-based, but many programs use <b>graphical</b> <b>user interfaces</b>, also known as GUIs.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.6455078125,
              321.169921875
            ],
            [
              527.73046875,
              321.169921875
            ],
            [
              527.73046875,
              344.0
            ],
            [
              128.6455078125,
              344.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/200/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/200/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/200/Text/4",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Python provides several choices for writing GUI-based programs, including wxPython, Tkinter, and Qt. Each has pros and cons, which is why Python has not converged on a standard.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.794921875,
              353.07421875
            ],
            [
              528.029296875,
              353.07421875
            ],
            [
              528.029296875,
              389.0
            ],
            [
              128.794921875,
              389.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/200/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/200/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/200/Text/5",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>The one I will present in this chapter is Tkinter because I think it is the easiest to get started with. Most of the concepts in this chapter apply to the other GUI modules, too.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.49609375,
              397.93359375
            ],
            [
              527.73046875,
              397.93359375
            ],
            [
              527.73046875,
              422.0
            ],
            [
              128.49609375,
              422.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/200/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/200/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/200/Text/6",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>There are several books and web pages about Tkinter. One of the best online resources is <i>An Introduction to Tkinter</i> by Fredrik Lundh.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.3466796875,
              430.8046875
            ],
            [
              527.1328125,
              430.8046875
            ],
            [
              527.1328125,
              455.0
            ],
            [
              128.3466796875,
              455.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/200/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/200/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/200/Text/7",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>I have written a module called Gui.py that comes with Swampy. It provides a simplified interface to the functions and classes in Tkinter. The examples in this chapter are based on this module.</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.49609375,
              464.44921875
            ],
            [
              527.73046875,
              464.44921875
            ],
            [
              527.73046875,
              500.0
            ],
            [
              128.49609375,
              500.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/200/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/200/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/200/Text/8",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Here is a simple example that creates and displays a Gui:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.3466796875,
              509.30859375
            ],
            [
              381.90234375,
              509.30859375
            ],
            [
              381.90234375,
              520.13671875
            ],
            [
              128.3466796875,
              520.13671875
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/200/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/200/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/200/Text/9",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>To create a GUI, you have to import Gui from Swampy:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.49609375,
              529.8046875
            ],
            [
              374.73046875,
              529.8046875
            ],
            [
              374.73046875,
              541.0
            ],
            [
              128.49609375,
              541.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/200/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/200/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/200/Text/10",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>from swampy.Gui import *</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.86962890625,
              551.0
            ],
            [
              255.0,
              551.0
            ],
            [
              255.0,
              561.90234375
            ],
            [
              128.86962890625,
              561.90234375
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/200/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/200/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/200/Text/11",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Or, depending on how you installed Swampy, like this:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.72021484375,
              570.41015625
            ],
            [
              371.7421875,
              570.41015625
            ],
            [
              371.7421875,
              582.0
            ],
            [
              128.72021484375,
              582.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/200/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/200/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/200/Text/12",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>from Gui import *</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.49609375,
              592.0
            ],
            [
              219.0,
              592.0
            ],
            [
              219.0,
              602.89453125
            ],
            [
              128.49609375,
              602.89453125
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/200/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/200/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/200/Text/13",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Then instantiate a Gui object:</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              128.9443359375,
              611.40234375
            ],
            [
              258.0,
              611.40234375
            ],
            [
              258.0,
              623.0
            ],
            [
              128.9443359375,
              623.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/200/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/200/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/200/Code/14",
          "block_type": "Code",
          "html": "<pre>g = Gui()\ng.title('Gui')\ng.mainloop()</pre>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              127.82373046875,
              632.0
            ],
            [
              203.0,
              632.0
            ],
            [
              203.0,
              668.0
            ],
            [
              127.82373046875,
              668.0
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/200/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/200/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/200/Text/15",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p class=\"has-continuation\">When you run this code, a window should appear with an empty gray square and the title Gui. mainloop runs the <b>event loop</b>, which waits for the user to do something and</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              127.8984375,
              677.91796875
            ],
            [
              527.73046875,
              677.91796875
            ],
            [
              527.73046875,
              701.12109375
            ],
            [
              127.8984375,
              701.12109375
            ]
          ],
          "children": null,
          "section_hierarchy": {
            "1": "/page/200/SectionHeader/1",
            "3": "/page/200/SectionHeader/2"
          },
          "images": {}
        }
