        {
          "id": "/page/202/Text/9",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>One of the most versatile widgets is the Canvas, which creates a region for drawing lines, circles and other shapes. If you did Exercise 15.4 you are already familiar with canvases.</p>",
