          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/202/Text/22",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Gui.py provides a standard Cartesian coordinate system with the origin at the center of the Canvas and the positive y axis pointing up. This is different from some other graphics systems where the origin is in the upper left corner, with the y axis pointing down.</p>",
          "polygon": [
