          "id": "/page/204/Text/9",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p><b>Exercise 19.3.</b> <i>Modify your solution to Exercise 19.2 by adding an Entry widget and a second</i> <i>button. When the user presses the second button, it should read a color name from the Entry and</i> <i>use it to change the fill color of the circle. Use</i> config <i>to modify the existing circle; don't create a</i> <i>new one.</i></p>",
