        {
          "id": "/page/205/Text/7",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>The first button uses self.canvas.dump as a callback; the second uses self.quit. These are <b>bound methods</b>, which means they are associated with a particular object. When they are invoked, they are invoked on the object.</p>",
          "polygon": [
