        {
          "id": "/page/205/Text/10",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>The first argument to row is a list of weights that determines how extra space is allocated between widgets. The list [0,1] means that all extra space is allocated to the second widget, which is the Entry. If you run this code and resize the window, you will see that the Entry grows and the Button doesn't.</p>",
