              "images": {}
            },
            {
              "id": "/page/221/ListItem/4",
              "block_type": "ListItem",
              "html": "<li> Superstitious beliefs (\"the computer hates me\") and magical thinking (\"the program only works when I wear my hat backward\").</li>",
