        {
          "id": "/page/233/Text/9",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>The first line imports the Lumpy class from swampy.Lumpy. If you don't have Swampy installed as a package, make sure the Swampy files are in Python's search path and use this import statement instead:</p>",
