          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/236/Text/10",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>When I use Lumpy to make object diagrams, I usually define the functions and classes before I make the reference point. That way, function and class objects don't appear in the diagram.</p>",
