          },
          "images": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "/page/237/Text/10",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p>Although I distinguish between state diagrams, stack diagrams and object diagrams, they are mostly the same thing: they show the state of a running program at a point in time.</p>",
